msgstr "Bouton de pointeur lent"

#. Keep the space at the start or end: the text is joined to another.
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7683
msgid "    Slower by"
msgstr "    Ralenti de"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7688
msgid "Click"
msgstr "Clic"

#. A menu row's value, shown at its right: keep it short (about 15 characters).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7691
msgid "Slows the pointer"
msgstr "Pointeur lent"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7693
msgid "On-screen keyboard"
msgstr "Clavier à l'écran"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7701
msgid "Reset to default"
msgstr "Rétablir la valeur par défaut"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7704
msgid "Save as my mapping"
msgstr "Garder comme ma configuration"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7707
msgid "Use my mapping"
msgstr "Utiliser ma configuration"

#. A button hint along the bottom of the screen, beside a button's picture: keep it short (one or two words).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7719
msgid "Choose a key"
msgstr "Choisir une touche"

#. A button hint along the bottom of the screen, beside a button's picture: keep it short (one or two words).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7719 title/pc5_ui.c:9193
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Réinitialiser"

#. A menu row's name (about 30 characters fit).
#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7720 title/pc5_ui.c:8761 title/pc5_ui.c:8832
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Enregistrer"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7720
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Utiliser"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7741
#, c-format
msgid "What %s sends"
msgstr "Ce qu'envoie %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7759
msgid "The usual way for older games like this one, with their 2D and 3D."
msgstr ""
"Le mode habituel des anciens jeux comme celui-ci, avec leur 2D et leur 3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7760
msgid ""
"The fastest, and what most games want. Leave it here unless the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Le plus rapide, et ce que veulent la plupart des jeux. Gardez-le, sauf si "
"le jeu ne démarre pas ou si son image est incorrecte."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7762
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game, slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Une autre façon d'afficher le jeu, plus lente qu'Auto. Essayez-la si le "
"jeu ne démarre pas ou si son image est incorrecte."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7764
msgid ""
"Draws everything in 2D, the way ordinary Windows programs are drawn. For a "
"2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen; a game with 3D "
"scenes won't start with it."
msgstr ""
"Dessine tout en 2D, comme les programmes Windows ordinaires. Pour un jeu "
"2D qui scintille ou n'affiche qu'une partie de son écran ; un jeu avec des "
"scènes en 3D ne démarrera pas avec."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7766
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong with Auto; "
"faster than Compatibility. Some mods need it."
msgstr ""
"Une autre façon d'afficher le jeu. Essayez-la si l'image est incorrecte "
"avec Auto ; plus rapide que Compatibilité. Certains mods en ont besoin."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7767
msgid ""
"The slowest, but it starts the most games. Try it if the game won't start "
